    <preface>
      <p>National Broadband Network Companies Amendment (Commitment to Public Ownership) Act 2025</p>
      <p>No. 27, 2025</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law relating to companies associated with the national broadband network, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	2</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments	3</p>
