                </content>
                <section eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-13__qstr-1__sec-43A">
                  <num>43A</num>
                  <heading>Parliament’s intention in relation to operation of the national broadband network and ownership of NBN Co</heading>
                  <content>
                    <p>It is the Parliament’s intention, in recognition of the importance of the national broadband network as nation-wide infrastructure, that:</p>
                  </content>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-13__qstr-1__sec-43A__para-a">
                    <num>a</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>the national broadband network is operated by NBN Co; and</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-13__qstr-1__sec-43A__para-b">
                    <num>b</num>
                    <content>
